      "description": "The meme uses the phrase 'we'll move to yours!' to imply a hostile, invasive, or predatory intent toward another country or group, which is a common xenophobic trope. This requires background knowledge of how such rhetoric is used to incite fear and hostility toward foreign populations or nations.",
