      "description": "The phrase 'once we are done destroying our country we'll move to yours!' is a form of propagandistic rhetoric that frames aggression as a strategic or inevitable step. This requires background knowledge of how such rhetoric is used in political discourse to justify hostile actions or to create a sense of impending threat.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
