      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The person in the hazmat suit is mapped as 'we' in the text",
      "description": "The text 'once we are done destroying our country' explicitly refers to 'we', which is analogically mapped onto the visual entity 'person' in the hazmat suit. The person is the agent performing the action of spraying, which is metaphorically 'destroying' the country, thus embodying the collective 'we' mentioned in the text.",
