      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the 'your' in the text",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the pronoun 'your' in the bottom text 'we'll move to yours!', which directly addresses the viewer or the viewer's country as the target of the threat. This creates an implicit 'you' as the recipient of the hostile message, making the user feel personally addressed and targeted by the meme's narrative.",
